<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' 11-mth budget surplus 10.65 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippines' 11-mth budget surplus 10.65 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a budget surplus of 10.65 billion pesos in the first eleven months of the year, up from 10.396 billion pesos in the year-ago period, the Bureau of Treasury said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    FISCAL SURPLUS    Jan-Nov 96    Jan-Oct 96    Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p>(in billion pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues	     379.557	 341.379	 330.350</p>
<p>    Expenditures	 368.907	 334.529	 319.954</p>
<p>    Surplus		 10.650	   6.850	  10.396</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
